@api = http://localhost:5081

### 1. Kiem tra API dang chay -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Chao tieng Viet (mac dinh) -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/hello/An?language=vi

### 3. Chao tieng Anh -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/hello/An?language=en

### 4. Chao tieng Nhat (Muc 8.5) -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/hello/An?language=ja

### 5. Tao loi chao hop le -> 201 Created + header Location
POST {{api}}/greetings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Binh" }

### 6. Ten rong -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{api}}/greetings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "" }
